sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Lead as Lead Agent
  participant CMD as Command Facade
  participant Exec as Execution Service
  participant Node as Node Agent
  participant Lease as Device Lease
  participant Lst as lstest Runner
  participant Evid as Evidence Store
  participant Rec as Receipt Signer
  participant EV as Event Log
  Lead->>CMD: request_real_execution(task_id, plan_hash)
  CMD->>Exec: dispatch(adapter=lstest, run_mode=real)
  Exec->>Node: acquire node + device lease
  Node->>Lease: compare-and-set lease
  Lease-->>Node: lease_id
  Node->>Lst: preflight(profile, endpoints)
  Lst-->>Node: preflight result
  alt 预检失败
    Node->>Evid: 保存预检证据
    Node-->>CMD: BLOCKED_HUMAN / repair request
  else 预检通过
    Node->>Lst: run(profile, samples)
    Lst->>Evid: 写入原始日志、音频、结果表
    Lst-->>Node: runner exit + artifact manifest
    Node->>Rec: sign(receipt)
    Rec-->>Exec: signed receipt
    Exec->>EV: append execution.completed
    Exec-->>CMD: run summary + evidence refs
  end
  Note over Node,Lst: 只有 real + 签名回执可作为 C2 证据；dry-run 只允许预检
